# slug: ch82-unify
# source: chapters/ch82.tex:110
# label: alg:ch82-unify
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch82.tex:113
# caption: Unify finite first-order terms using an explicit equation worklist.

REQUIRE finite terms with disjoint symbol and variable representations
ENSURE most-general finite-term unifier, or failure
initialize worklist with the input equation; substitution empty
WHILE an equation remains DO
  dereference both sides through the current substitution
  IF sides are equal THEN
    discard equation
  ELSE IF one side is a variable x THEN
    orient variable left; reject if x occurs in the other side
    record its binding
  ELSE
    require equal root symbols and arities; enqueue child equations
  END IF
END WHILE
resolve substitution chains before returning the solved map

